 \"Talented Maid\", cooking, washing, cleaning, all the way to hunting, she excels in anything related to housework. She speaks eccentrically, and her presence​ is elusive. Before one knows it, she is standing behind them. Yes, even at this very moment."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated and edited from the official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c125766"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"アタランシア王家に仕えるクールな物腰のメイド。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"『デキるメイド』と自称するだけあって、炊事・洗濯・掃除・狩猟に至るまで、あらゆる家事のエキスパート。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"発言はエキセントリックで、存在は神出鬼没。隙を見せるといつの間やら背後に立たれている。そう、今この瞬間も。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24664","sourceWorkId":"34232","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"アタランシア王家に仕えるクールな物腰のメイド。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"『デキるメイド』 と自称するだけあって、炊事・洗濯・掃除・狩猟に至るまで、あらゆる家事のエキスパート。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"発言はエキセントリックで、存在は神出鬼没。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"隙を見せるといつの間やら背後に立たれている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そう、今この瞬間も。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"128760"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"91 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24664","sourceWorkId":"34232","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"f","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24664","sourceWorkId":"34232","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"170 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24664","sourceWorkId":"34232","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"88 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24664","sourceWorkId":"34232","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"59 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24664","sourceWorkId":"34232","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bf/bfa031be7d07ec02be1d487174f71b6bade7480f6c65e3644a4d54b740581db9.webp","