r is said to have come to the kingdom during a war (probably WW2) when his ship sank and passed away recently at the age of 100 while the game mentions smartphones, the game is set at least post 2007, making her at least 40 years old by the time the game takes place"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c125767"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"海底都市アタランシアの第二王女で、イリオネーラの実妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"引っ込み思案で人見知りだが、一度心を許した相手にはぐいぐい来ることも。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"身体が弱く、激しい運動ができない体質。すぐに息切れしてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"趣味は読書で、城の書庫によく出入りしてる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24665","sourceWorkId":"34232","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"海底都市アタランシアの第二王女で、イリオネーラの実妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"引っ込み思案で人見知りだが、一度心を許した相手にはぐいぐい来ることも。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"身体が弱く、激しい運動ができない体質。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"すぐに息切れしてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"越味は読書で、城の書庫によく出入りしてる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"128761"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"63 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24665","sourceWorkId":"34232","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"aa","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24665","sourceWorkId":"34232","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"140 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24665","sourceWorkId":"34232","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"67 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24665","sourceWorkId":"34232","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"54 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24665","sourceWorkId":"34232","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/75/75c0ce73866ee70f29fa548d6204bb4fc4cc7c258081969d0b0e6762bafd76c3.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wi